# App Version

Before committing changes that will be pushed:

- Increment `APP_VERSION` in `src/lib/appVersion.ts`.
- Preserve the `major.minor.patch` format with two-digit minor and three-digit patch fields.
- Increment the patch field by one for ordinary changes (for example, `1.01.047` → `1.01.048`).
- Include the version change in the same commit being pushed.
